        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Nowadays, it is not only large companies that are able to make films, as digital technology enables anyone to produce films. Do you think it is a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcARdkcuJoJxRkxJfS4lnc4JgTH\"><strong>Nowadays, it is not only large companies that are able to make films, as digital technology enables anyone to produce films. Do you think it is a positive or negative development?</strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Digital Filmmaking Trend&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Digital Filmmaking Trend&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong>&nbsp;Ng&agrave;y nay, kh&ocirc;ng chỉ c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn mới c&oacute; khả năng l&agrave;m phim v&igrave; c&ocirc;ng nghệ kỹ thuật số cho ph&eacute;p bất kỳ ai cũng c&oacute; thể sản xuất phim</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Digital Filmmaking Trend&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMbvd0hgKofDmuxvMDElbqfmgBe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>the ability for anyone to produce films (khả năng m&agrave; ai cũng c&oacute; thể sản xuất phim)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; của xu hướng n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeCkdNayooZiasxvZUwlLX1Ag6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6DFdb7UeoXdCaxuQSBlQa9Ogqe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, <em>khả năng tiếp cận rộng r&atilde;i (the widespread accessibility)</em> với c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng cụ l&agrave;m phim đ&atilde; tạo ra<strong> </strong>một số vấn đề đ&aacute;ng lo ngại</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RZcKdzjBwoBusIxbaEIlhfDYgqd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVo7dxNVLocvDlxCCqHlH0RLgJe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Một vấn đề l&agrave; <em>vi phạm bản quyền (copyright infringement)</em>, v&igrave; c&aacute;c nh&agrave; l&agrave;m phim nghiệp dư thường thiếu kiến thức đ&uacute;ng đắn về <em>luật bản quyền (copyright laws).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KjNqdxKIeoxtmTxENlElmNIhgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y dẫn đến <em>việc sử dụng tr&aacute;i ph&eacute;p (the unauthorized use of)</em> &acirc;m nhạc, <em>cảnh quay (footage)</em> hoặc <em>t&agrave;i sản tr&iacute; tuệ (intellectual property)</em> trong c&aacute;c sản phẩm của họ, g&acirc;y ra những th&aacute;ch thức ph&aacute;p l&yacute; v&agrave;<em> l&agrave;m giảm gi&aacute; trị (devaluation)</em> của c&aacute;c t&aacute;c phẩm s&aacute;ng tạo gốc.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VmJ7d25upop9tUxS1JAllTohgNg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LiG4de0dzof40cx8fEdls7wagFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Một nhược điểm kh&aacute;c l&agrave; <em>sự b&atilde;o h&ograve;a nội dung (content oversaturation)</em>, v&igrave; <em>r&agrave;o cản gia nhập thấp (low barrier to entry)</em> đ&atilde; dẫn đến lượng video khổng lồ tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c nền tảng kỹ thuật số</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RHQxdyZRYoZpU6x5wBXlPX4Egag\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> C&aacute;c trang web chia sẻ video hiện <em>đang ngập tr&agrave;n (be flooded with)</em> những nội dung tương tự, thường l&agrave; c&aacute;c sản phẩm kh&ocirc;ng được đầu tư nhiều c&ocirc;ng sức, khiến người xem ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng kh&oacute; khăn trong việc kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; t&agrave;i liệu chất lượng giữa <em>v&ocirc; số th&ocirc;ng tin ồn &agrave;o (the overwhelming noise).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TxrhdY5gSooM4IxJahHlrGSjgkb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những bất lợi n&agrave;y được b&ugrave; lại bởi c&aacute;c kh&iacute;a cạnh t&iacute;ch cực của sự ph&aacute;t triển n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXfqdgollov4jlxHOMxlUAIWgqd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLq3d1hzxo3YIKx4veAlKwGGgAe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Sự tự do s&aacute;ng tạo c&oacute; được th&ocirc;ng qua c&ocirc;ng nghệ dễ tiếp cận cho ph&eacute;p c&aacute;c nh&agrave; l&agrave;m phim l&agrave;m việc <em>m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng bị r&agrave;ng buộc (without the constraints of) </em>bởi <em>y&ecirc;u cầu của h&atilde;ng phim (studio demands)</em> hoặc <em>kỳ vọng thương mại (commercial expectations).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JvBwdxmT8otPaSx1tbjlU9OPg0g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact</strong>: Điều n&agrave;y đ&atilde; dẫn đến nhiều phim thử nghiệm kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; <em>c&aacute;c kỹ thuật kể chuyện kh&ocirc;ng mang t&iacute;nh truyền thống (unconventional storytelling techniques)</em>, tạo ra <em>c&aacute;ch biểu đạt nghệ thuật ch&acirc;n thực v&agrave; c&aacute; nh&acirc;n hơn (more authentic and personal artistic expression)</em>, cũng như đổi mới trong phong c&aacute;ch l&agrave;m phim</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BaPNd6J5Gol93zx83BDlouuwgQd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoRbdJnEAoSg4ZxUhf5lv8Csg1w\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Ngo&agrave;i ra, sự thay đổi c&ocirc;ng nghệ n&agrave;y tạo ra những cơ hội gi&aacute;o dục qu&yacute; gi&aacute; khi cho ph&eacute;p học sinh <em>tham gia v&agrave;o (engage with)</em> những trải nghiệm l&agrave;m phim thực tế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ook9dJrvoo3cWHxifVXlVD0ogyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> C&aacute;c dự &aacute;n học đường nơi học sinh tạo ra phim t&agrave;i liệu về c&aacute;c vấn đề cộng đồng địa phương gi&uacute;p ph&aacute;t triển <em>kỹ năng kỹ thuật số của họ (their digital literacy and technical skills),</em> mở ra những con đường nghề nghiệp mới ngo&agrave;i c&aacute;c tổ chức l&agrave;m phim truyền thống.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LuP6d7JcNomKxzxUlHJlThqKgLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LMOGdUKHBoxVn6xhLKElAVMOgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>copyright issues and content volume <em>(vấn đề bản quyền v&agrave; khối lượng nội dung)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZBHzdMaQ7oxBAvxQGxNlgyqFgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">greater creative freedom and enhanced learning opportunities <em>(tự do s&aacute;ng tạo hơn v&agrave; tăng cường cơ hội học tập)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 958,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lka6d7KIfo5C4CxqE91lJTNsgGq\">Opinions are divided on whether the ability for anyone to produce films through digital technology, rather than just large companies, is beneficial. Although this trend presents certain challenges, I believe its advantages are more significant.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16229,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 959,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZO2SdGz5Ko3YK3xxJc1lya5vgMh\"><strong>Admittedly, the widespread accessibility of filmmaking tools has created some concerning issues</strong>. <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One problem is copyright infringement, as amateur filmmakers often lack proper knowledge about copyright laws. This leads to the unauthorized use of music, footage, or intellectual property in their productions, resulting in legal challenges and the devaluation of original creative work</span>. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Another drawback is content oversaturation, as the low barrier to entry has led to a massive influx of videos on digital platforms. Consequently, video-sharing websites are now flooded with similar, often low-effort content, making it increasingly difficult for viewers to discover quality material among the overwhelming noise.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16229,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 960,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VOfMdCZo3oDuxfxZcytlyJGHg2c\"><strong>However, I believe these disadvantages are outweighed by the positive aspects of this development.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The creative freedom gained through accessible technology allows filmmakers to work without the constraints of studio demands or commercial expectations. This has led to more experimental films that explore unconventional storytelling techniques, resulting in more authentic and personal artistic expression, as well as innovation in filmmaking styles.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, this technological shift creates valuable educational opportunities as it allows students to engage with practical filmmaking experiences. School projects where students create documentaries about local community issues help develop their digital literacy and technical skills, opening new career pathways outside traditional film institutions.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16229,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 961,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P8Y0dEVJ5oHD0Zx93i4lCEn2gcd\">In conclusion, while the ability for anyone to make films does create challenges related to copyright issues and content volume, I believe the benefits of greater creative freedom and enhanced learning opportunities are more significant overall.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 16229,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
